I'd say this pretty much sums it up. Consider that what you wish for can 
be ANY name you could possibly see in your inventory; if it's possible 
to have an item that's a "spellbook of Force Bolt" then you can wish for 
it; but you can also wish for a "dark green spellbook" if you so desire.

It's worth noting that my very first wish ever was for a "bag of 
holding", not even knowing if such an item existed in the game. I just 
imagined, if I could have ANYTHING in the world, what would be the most 
useful? Imagine my surprise when the game correctly parsed my request. 
So just think about what you would really like to have.

